5,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I worry about us living together after this. Let's pick something that keeps doors open.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"I just want a place where we can all breathe easy, without the smell or the noise.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I need to know the exact time cost for each of us before we agree to anything.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Rin,,"I am small, but I see big problems. Why does one house have the bin right at their gate?","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
