35,2,1,talk,Kenji,,The log shows one house filed most complaints. The measurements show one house is very narrow.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Shizue,,The truck comes so early. I worry about the noise waking the children and the elderly.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Asuka,,The filing takes four months. That is a long time to wait for a simple fix.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Rin,,I found the ledger. One house pays for the extra fees. That is not fair to the rest of us.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Servas,,"I found the subsidy covers forty percent, but the ledger shows we waste money on open bags.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Rin, if one house pays extra, maybe we should share that cost more evenly?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Shizue,,The early truck is a problem. Can we ask the crew to come later?,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Asuka,,The four-month wait is unacceptable. We need a temporary solution that is easy to file.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Rin,,"I think we should move the bin to the middle. That way, no one is stuck with it at their gate.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Servas,,"The subsidy is a good start, but we must stop the waste. If we keep the bags closed, we save money.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Kenji,,Moving it to the middle sounds good. It feels fairer to everyone.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Shizue,,I agree. But we must make sure the truck can still reach it easily.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Asuka,,A temporary solution in the middle might be easier to file. Let's look at that.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Rin,,"Yes! A middle spot is an adventure for the bin, but a fair one for us.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Servas,,"A middle spot, with closed bags, and a shared cost. That is a balanced path forward.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Kenji,,"I like the idea of a middle spot. It keeps us connected, not divided.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Shizue,,"I am happy to help set it up. We can do this together, gently.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Asuka,,I will draft the filing for a temporary middle spot. It is the most logical step.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Rin,,"I will help carry the bin! I am small, but I am strong. Let's make it fair.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Servas,,We have found a way to share the burden and the benefit. That is the true spirit of the neighbourhood.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
